# Python — producer & consumer

## Stack

- `requests`, `kafka-python`, `python-dotenv`, `elasticsearch`, `textblob`
- Load config via `load_dotenv()` from repo-root `.env`

## Patterns

- JSON Kafka values; URL as message key when possible
- Idempotent ES indexing: document `id` = article URL
- English comments on non-obvious logic only
- Exit non-zero on failure; print clear errors to stderr

## Connectivity

| From | Kafka | Elasticsearch |
|------|-------|-----------------|
| Host (venv) | `localhost:9092` | `http://localhost:9200` |
| Airflow container | `kafka:29092` | N/A in producer DAG |

Reference implementations: `docs/02-kafka.md`, `docs/04-elasticsearch.md`.
